msgstr "`capability_analysis(..., transform='yeo-johnson')`"

msgid "Con especificaciones, no normal y sin un modelo claramente mejor"
msgstr "With specifications, non-normal and no clearly better model"

msgid "`capability_analysis` (con aviso de cautela y `ci_method='bootstrap'`)"
msgstr "`capability_analysis` (with a caution warning and `ci_method='bootstrap'`)"

msgid "Sin especificaciones, datos asimétricos que Box-Cox o Yeo-Johnson normalizan"
msgstr "Without specifications, skewed data that Box-Cox or Yeo-Johnson normalize"

msgid "`imr_chart(datos, transform='boxcox' | 'yeo-johnson')`"
msgstr "`imr_chart(data, transform='boxcox' | 'yeo-johnson')`"

msgid "Sin especificaciones, en los demás casos"
msgstr "Without specifications, in all other cases"

msgid "`imr_chart` (con aviso si los datos son asimétricos)"
msgstr "`imr_chart` (with a warning if the data are skewed)"

